# Confidential local data
band_crawl_schedule.json
database/exports/
/docs/code-review
.superpowers/
# NOT ignored: /docs/superpowers/ holds design specs for shipped architecture.
# Ignoring them repeated the #818 failure — the untracked instructions/ tree that
# existed on one machine and nowhere else, so a fresh clone, CI and delegated runs
# resolved none of it. Same reason docs/REPORT_CARD_REVIEW.md is tracked on
# purpose. They stay OFF the published docs site via mkdocs.yml's exclude_docs,
# not by being absent from git.
docs/SEO_IMPROVEMENTS.md

# GitGuardian local scan cache
.cache_ggshield

# Lighthouse CI run output (uploaded as a CI artifact, never committed)
frontend/.lighthouseci/
